MODULE: NoDecisionUnderReadGateGateIgnored
TARGET: NoDecisionUnderReadGate
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: The registry accepts a new decision while the read gate is live.
PERTURBS: WriterOpportunity
--- FIND
    /\ (Prepare \/ Decide \/ WriterIdle)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: decision admission ignores a live reader.
    /\ (Prepare \/ Decide \/ WriterIdle
        \/ (saga = "prepared" /\ saga' = "decided" /\ registryVersion' = 1 - registryVersion
            /\ crossed' = (IF reader \in {"read", "validate"} THEN TRUE ELSE crossed)
            /\ UNCHANGED <<drained, checkpointed, completed, terminalWitness>>))
--- END
